  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Abysses.Level.PuzzleObjective
  ShowTopMostFoldoutHeaderGroup: 1
  floor: 3
  quadrant: -1
  label: Chasse des ballasts
  labelEnglish: Ballast blow
  hints:
  - "Une fois les pompes amorc\xE9es et la purge termin\xE9e, il faut chasser les
    ballasts pour descendre."
  - "Chaque module a un levier de chasse pr\xE8s du mur commun : il faut les abaisser
    tous ensemble."
  - "Comptez \xE0 voix haute : \xAB 3, 2, 1, maintenant ! \xBB \u2014 moins de 2
    secondes d'\xE9cart entre les leviers."
  hintsEnglish:
  - Once the pumps are primed and the purge is done, the ballasts must be blown to
    go down.
  - 'Each module has a blow lever near the shared wall: pull them all together.'
  - "Count out loud: \u201C3, 2, 1, now!\u201D \u2014 less than 2 seconds between
    the levers."
